OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%,.** %-,(,%,. (,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ACrew unaware of risks before Mike      
OL,4,ALynch's yacht Bayesian sank, say       
OL,5,Ainvestigators                          
OL,7,FThe sinking of the Bayesian unfolded   
OL,8,Fwith "extraordinary speed" when a      
OL,9,Fviolent downburst of freak             
OL,10,Fhurricane-force winds knocked it onto  
OL,11,Fits side in less than 15 seconds, the  
OL,12,FUK's Marine Accident Investigation     
OL,13,FBranch (MAIB) final report said.       
OL,15,FSafety information provided to the crew
OL,16,Fdid not identify this type of risk, the
OL,17,FMAIB said.                             
